{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2co-8-1","title":"2 Corinthians 8:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He stirs them up to a liberal contribution for the poor saints at Jerusalem, by the example of the Macedonians; 7 by commendation of their former forwardness; 9 by the example of Christ; 14 and by the spiritual profit that shall redound to themselves thereby; 16 commending to them the integrity and willingness of Titus, and those other brethren, who upon his request, exhortation, and commendation, were purposely come to them for this business.</p>\n<p>we. 19 the grace. 2-7; 9:12; Ac 11:23; 1Co 15:10; Eph 3:8; Col 1:29 churches. 9:2,4; 11:9; Ac 16:9; Ro 15:26; 1Th 1:7,8; 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-2","title":"2 Corinthians 8:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>in. 1Th 1:6; 2:14; 3:3,4 the abundance. Ne 8:10-12; Ac 2:45,46 their deep. Mr 12:42-44; Lu 21:1-4; Jas 2:5; Re 2:9 the riches. 6:10; 9:11,13; De 15:4; Pr 11:25; Isa 32:5-8 liberality. Gr. simplicity. 1:12; Ro 12:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-3","title":"2 Corinthians 8:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>to. 9:6,7; Mr 14:8; Ac 11:29; 1Co 16:2; 1Pe 4:11 I bear. Ro 10:2; Ga 4:15; Col 4:13 beyond. 12,16,17; Ex 35:5,21,22,29; 1Ch 29:5,6,9,13-17; Ps 110:3; 1Co 9:17 Php 2:13; 1Th 2:8; Phm 1:14; 1Pe 5:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-4","title":"2 Corinthians 8:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>that. 18,19; Ge 33:10,11; 2Ki 5:15,16; Ac 16:15; 1Co 16:3,4 the ministering. 9:1,12-14; Mt 10:42; 12:50; 25:40,44,45; Mr 14:7; Joh 19:26,27 Ac 6:1-7; 9:39-41; 11:29; 24:17; Ro 15:25,26; 1Co 16:1,3,4,15 Ga 2:10; 6:10; 1Ti 5:10; Phm 1:5,6; Heb 6:10; 1Jo 3:16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-5","title":"2 Corinthians 8:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>first. 5:14,15; 1Sa 1:28; 2Ch 30:8; Isa 44:3-5; Jer 31:33; Zec 13:9 Ro 6:13; 12:1; 14:7-9; 1Co 6:19,20 unto. 4:5; 1Ch 12:18; 2Ch 30:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-6","title":"2 Corinthians 8:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>we. 16,17; 12:18 grace. or, gift. 4,19; *marg: 9:5; Php 4:18; 1Pe 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-7","title":"2 Corinthians 8:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>as. Ro 15:14; 1Co 1:5; 4:7; 12:13; 14:12; Re 3:17 faith. 1Co 13:2 knowledge. 1Co 8:1,2; 13:8 in your. 7:7 see. 9:8; Php 1:9,11; 1Th 4:9,10; 2Th 1:3; 1Pe 1:22; 2Pe 1:5-8 this. 6; 9:14; Eph 4:29; 2Ti 2:1; Heb 12:28; 2Pe 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-8","title":"2 Corinthians 8:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>speak. 10; 9:7; 1Co 7:6,12,25 by occasion. 1-3; 9:2; Ro 11:12-14; Heb 10:24 prove. 24; 6:6; Jos 24:14; Eze 33:31; Ro 12:9; Eph 4:15; *marg: Eph 6:24; Jas 2:14-16; 1Pe 1:22; 1Jo 3:17-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-9","title":"2 Corinthians 8:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>the grace. 13:14; Joh 1:14,17; Ro 5:8,20,21; 1Co 1:4; Eph 1:6-8; 2:7; 3:8,19 though. Ps 102:25-27; Joh 1:1-4,10; 16:15; 1Co 15:47; Php 2:6; Col 1:16,17 Heb 1:2,6-14 for. Isa 62:1; 65:8; Joh 12:30; 17:19; Col 1:24 he became. Isa 53:2; Mt 8:20; 17:27; 20:28; Mr 6:3; Lu 2:7; 8:3; 9:58; Php 2:6-8 that ye. 6:10; Lu 16:11; Ro 8:32; 11:12; 1Co 3:21,22; Eph 3:8; 1Ti 6:18 Jas 2:5; Re 3:18; 21:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-10","title":"2 Corinthians 8:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I give. 1Co 7:25,40 expedient. 12:1; Pr 19:17; Mt 10:42; Joh 11:50; 16:7; 18:14; 1Co 6:12; 10:23 Php 4:17; 1Ti 6:18,19; Heb 13:16; Jas 2:15,16 to be. 8; 9:2 forward. Gr. willing. 3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-12","title":"2 Corinthians 8:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>if. 9:7; Ex 25:2; 35:5,21,22,29; 1Ch 29:3-18; 2Ch 6:8; Pr 19:22 Mr 12:42-44; 14:7,8; Lu 7:44-46; 12:47,48; 16:10; 21:1-4; 1Pe 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-13","title":"2 Corinthians 8:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>not. Ac 4:34; Ro 15:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-15","title":"2 Corinthians 8:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Ex 16:18; Lu 22:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-16","title":"2 Corinthians 8:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>thanks. Ezr 7:27; Ne 2:12; Jer 31:31; 32:40; Col 3:17; Re 17:17 earnest. 7:7,12; Php 2:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-17","title":"2 Corinthians 8:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>accepted. 6; Heb 13:22 but. 8,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-18","title":"2 Corinthians 8:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>the brother.This is generally supposed to have been Said. Luke, \"whose praise was in all the churches,\" on account of the gospel which he had written, and for many zealous services in its cause.</p>\n<p>19,22,23; 12:18 throughout. Ro 16:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-19","title":"2 Corinthians 8:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>but. 1-4; Ac 6:3-6; 15:22,25; 1Co 16:3,4 grace. or gift. 4,6,7; 9:8 to the. 1,2; 4:15; 9:12-14; Php 4:18,19; 1Pe 4:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-20","title":"2 Corinthians 8:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>that. 11:12; Mt 10:16; Ro 14:16; 1Co 16:3; Eph 5:15; 1Th 5:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-21","title":"2 Corinthians 8:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>for. Ro 12:17; Php 4:8; 1Ti 5:14; Tit 2:5-8; 1Pe 2:12 not. 2:17; 5:9-11; Mt 5:16; 6:1,4; 23:5; 1Th 5:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-22","title":"2 Corinthians 8:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>whom. Php 2:20-22 I have. or, he hath.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-23","title":"2 Corinthians 8:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Titus. 6,16; 7:6; 12:18 is my. Lu 5:7,10; Phm 1:17 and fellow-helper. Php 2:25; 4:3; Col 1:7; 1Th 2:2; Phm 1:24; 3Jo 1:8 the messengers. 19; Php 2:25; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-8-24","title":"2 Corinthians 8:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>8; 7:14; 9:2-4</p>"}]}